Verba
This repository combines RJ Ed Tech's own work with outside work that
is NOT RJ's. Each part keeps its own terms.

1. RJ Ed Tech's own work: the site, interface, teaching features and
   text written for Verba.
   Copyright (c) 2026 Jason Beyer, RJ Ed Tech
   Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0
   International (CC BY-NC 4.0):
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode
   Free to share and adapt for non-commercial use, with credit to
   "Verba, RJ Ed Tech" and a link to https://rjedtech.github.io/Verba/.

2. Whitaker's Words dictionary and morphological data, by William
   Whitaker (1936-2010), who released it for free and unrestricted use.
   Original program: https://github.com/mk270/whitakers-words
   RJ Ed Tech claims no ownership of this data.

3. The Latin parser is a JavaScript port of blagae/whitakers_words
   (https://github.com/blagae/whitakers_words), which is released under
   the MIT License. That project's MIT terms apply to the ported parser
   code, and its notice must be kept with any copy:

